  "body": "Currently a profile of a user can only be seen by another user if they share a room together. This is only enforced client-side. Some server admins may wish to turn this off i.e in a private federation setting. Add an option to configure this restriction.\r\n\r\nDINUM PR: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse-dinsic/pull/18",
